## 9. How to run (technical)

```powershell
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Process 1 — Qt event loop
python apps/pharmacy_simulator/main.py

# Process 2 — UIA automation (simulator must be running)
python apps/automation_controller/main.py --connect-only
python apps/automation_controller/main.py --enumerate
python apps/automation_controller/main.py --workflow fill_save
```

